2)	What are some of the free time activities you enjoy? Why do you enjoy that activity? Who do you enjoy
it with? Tell me about it with as many details as you can.
  
3)	Tell me about a place you like to visit in your free time. Why do you like to visit that place?
  What do you do there? Give me a detailed description about the place you like to visit.
  
4)	Do you think you have more free time or less free time compared to the past? Or is it the same?
  How is it different? Tell me in detail.
  
5)	You indicated in the survey that you like going to concerts. What kind of concert do you like to
go to? Why do you like it? How often do you go to concerts?
  
6)	Tell me about one of your recent experiences at a concert. It could be a festival held in your 
community or a show of a very famous artist. Describe your day with as many details as you can.
  
7)	Tell me about a memorable or unforgettable experience you had at a concert or a festival. What 
  happened? Why was it so memorable to you? Give me a detailed description about everything you remember.

8)	Many people these days eat healthy food to stay fit. What kinds of healthy foods do you eat? 
  How often do you eat them? Tell me about them with as many details as possible.
  
9)	What did you do to maintain your health when you were a child? How have your health habits 
changed over the years? What remains the same?
  
10)	Can you describe a specific incident where you focused on maintaining your health? This could
involve eating healthy food, exercising or any other activity. Please describe the incident for me.
  
11)	You want to make a reservation at a hair salon. Call the hair salon, tell them about the hair 
style you want and ask 3 or 4 questions to make reservations.
  
12)	I’m sorry but there is a problem. You are not happy with your new hair style. Tell the hairdresser
about the situation and ask what they can do for you.
  
13)	Have you ever had an experience that you were not satisfied with the service at a hair salon? 
  If so, what happened? Why were you not satisfied with it? How did you handle the situation?
  
14)	Tell me about the recycling system of your country. How do you recycle? Where do you recycle?
  What’s different from other countries? Tell me in detail.
  
15)	Are there any problems or issues regarding recycling in your country? Perhaps you have heard about
it on the news. What is it? Are there any ways to resolve the problem? Tell me about it with as many
details as possible.
